# Secrets & security

- Never commit `.env`, credentials, private keys, or tokens.
- Do not log passwords, JWTs, or PII unnecessarily.
- Mutating APIs must enforce authentication and company/tenant scope.
- Use parameterized queries / JPA — no string-built SQL.
- For `security: elevated` stories, require human merge approval after review.
